	- Annual SH demand[District,Performance,Type] / Efficiency[EH] * Carrier used cost per kWh\
		[District,EH] * (1 - Self sufficiency degree[District,ElectricHeater,Performance,Type\
		]) - 
	
	Annual SH demand[District,Performance,Type] / Efficiency[EH] * PV cumulative compensation price\
