Additional annual RCPv kWh produced by archetype[District,HS,Performance,Type,Battery\
		]=
	RCPv adoptions by archetype[District,HS,Performance,Type,Battery] * kWp installed per building RCPv\
		[District,Type] * PV annual generation per kW
