Market Share HS no incentives noDH noGas[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVpanel] :EXCEPT:\
		     [District,WithGas,Performance,Type,PVpanel]=
	Market Share HS no incentives noDH[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVpanel] / ( SUM(Market Share HS no incentives noDH\
		[District,HS!,Performance,Type,PVpanel]) - SUM(Market Share HS no incentives noDH[District\
		,WithGas!,Performance,Type,PVpanel]) ) ~~|
