HS Log Likelihood[OldS] :EXCEPT:  [ElectricHeater]=
	IF THEN ELSE( Time < 2025 , Adoption Heating Solutions Data[OldS] * LN( Average MS by HS\
		[OldS] ) , 0 ) ~~|
HS Log Likelihood[DH]=
	0 ~~|
