	IF THEN ELSE( Time < 2018 , Adoption Heating Solutions Data[ElectricHeater] * LN( Average MS by HS\
		[ElectricHeater] ) , 0 ) ~~|
HS Log Likelihood[NewS] :EXCEPT:   [DH]=
	IF THEN ELSE( Time < 2025 , Adoption Heating Solutions Data[NewS] * LN( Average MS by HS\
		[NewS] ) , 0 )
	~	
	~		~	:SUPPLEMENTARY 
